  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for e-health system(GoT-HoMIS) expansion in the Dodoma Region of Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KOICA is requested to support the 3 year test phase to develop adequate digital health solutions for the Tanzanian health sector and will also support the enhancement of digital solutions for the supply chain.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To accelerate increased access, improved quality, effective and efficient health care to all Tanzanians through digitally-enabled transformation of the health system. To strengthen the health system/reduce maternal and newborn mortality through the use of digital technologies for strengthened health information systems, improved financial management, efficient supply chain management of health commodities and improved quality of health services delivery.&#xBD84;&#xC808;&#xB41C; &#xC77C;&#xCC28;&#xC758;&#xB8CC;&#xAE30;&#xAD00;&#xC758; &#xC815;&#xBCF4;&#xCCB4;&#xACC4; &#xD1B5;&#xD569;; &#xC5C5;&#xBB34; &#xD504;&#xB85C;&#xC138;&#xC2A4; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xC5C5;&#xBB34; &#xD6A8;&#xC728;&#xD654; &#xBC0F; &#xC758;&#xC57D;&#xD488; &#xACF5;&#xAE09; &#xCCB4;&#xACC4; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;</narrative>
